  "title": "Monte Rosa Therapeutics Presents Preclinical Data at American Association for Cancer Research (AACR) Annual Meeting 2026 on the Potential of its Cyclin E1 (CCNE1)-directed Molecular Glue Degrader to Treat CCNE1-amplified Solid Tumors",
